# Documentation build
# NOTE: `docs/` is pkgdown's output directory, but it also holds the two
# hand-written reference manuals DESIGN_MATRIX.md and NUMERIC_ANCHORS.md that
# ?calculate points at. The negation patterns below keep those two in git.
/docs/*
!/docs/DESIGN_MATRIX.md
!/docs/NUMERIC_ANCHORS.md
site_local/
vign_preview/
*_files/
vignettes/*_files/
*.html

# Temporary files
tmp/
temp/
*.tmp
